  "content": "<div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ConvenientDecor/master/projectPage/images/header.jpg\" alt=\"便捷装饰\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ModPageAssets/main/badges/fabric-api.png\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmim1q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ModPageAssets/main/badges/ko-fi.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-Fi 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6TjQbSjbuB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ModPageAssets/main/badges/discord.png\" alt=\"加入我的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2><span>本模组引入了新的装饰性方块，其中一些还具备便捷功能！</span></h2>\n<p><span><strong>雨伞现已兼容 Origins 模组！</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>16 款时尚的引雷雨伞</li>\n<li>洒水壶，可永久保持农田湿润</li>\n<li>树叶堆和干草堆，怪物无法穿过</li>\n<li>风向标，可预测天气变化</li>\n<li>装饰性铲子和干草叉</li>\n<li>以及更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/mim1q/ConvenientDecor/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处查看便捷装饰的所有特性！</a></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ConvenientDecor/master/projectPage/images/rainy_update.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/ConvenientDecor/master/projectPage/images/screenshot.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fp%252flunapixel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mim1q/MineCells/1.20.x/projectPageAssets/hosting-code.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码 LUNAPIXEL 选择 Bisect 托管服务\"></a></div>",
